  "title": "First Light",
  "briefing": "Contingency Zero has woken you on Cairn, a dead colony world with metal in its bones. You are not alone: a Crucible vanguard has dug in on the far side of the proving grounds. Build Metal Extractors and power, raise a Bot Lab or Vehicle Plant, and break the raids they send to test you.",
