  "messages": [
    "Oversight online. The network starts with metal: build Metal Extractors on the glowing deposits.",
    "Every structure costs energy too. Solar Collectors are steady; Wind Turbines are cheap but fickle.",
    "Extractors humming. Now raise a factory. A Bot Lab is quick to start.",
    "Factory online. Queue a few units and set a rally point south of the base.",
    "Forward camp erased. They will remember that.",
    "Contact south! Crucible scouts probing the perimeter.",
    "Second raid inbound. Mortars with it: don't let them sit and shell you.",
    "Heavy signatures. Anvil tanks leading the third raid. Hold the line.",
    "Raid broken. They'll be back.",
    "Second raid scrapped.",
    "Third raid destroyed. The vanguard is spent.",
    "Perimeter secure. The network grows. Phase one complete."
  ],
